{"id":"2ce276183c963d6c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth.md","title":"Standard truth of arithmetic formulas","display":"df-arithmetic-standard-truth — Standard truth of arithmetic formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","aliases":["72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth"],"display":"df-arithmetic-standard-truth — Standard truth of arithmetic formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.6, printed p. 413, PDF p. 425; section 1.7 preceding lemma, printed p. 414, PDF p. 426","source_relation":"Explicit external standard-model interpretation of the truth component in rnt; local semantic interface, not a quoted numbered definition","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; well-founded formula recursion checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetic-standard-truth — Standard truth of arithmetic formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.6, printed p. 413, PDF p. 425; section 1.7 preceding lemma, printed p. 414, PDF p. 426"},{"key":"source_relation","html":"Explicit external standard-model interpretation of the truth component in rnt; local semantic interface, not a quoted numbered definition"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; well-founded formula recursion checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0118b1d3360ec7d\" href=\"?note=b0118b1d3360ec7d\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment\">72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta\">\\(\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta\\)</span>、各公式构造子及环境更新。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\">\\(t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\omega\">\\(i\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>。以下按有限公式树递归引入元关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\mathsf{AT}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；等价号右侧使用 ZFC 元语言的经典逻辑及标准自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\lor\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\lor\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本接口将原书 rnt 蕴涵子句中的真值分量显式落实为标准自然数结构中的外部满足关系，供本书现有较小算术语法复用。它是本次局部形式化配套定义，不是原书另有编号的定义，也不是 HA 内部的真谓词：未把公式编码放进算术语言，因而不涉及在 HA 中定义全体算术真理。</p>\n<p>每个递归调用只涉及严格子公式；原子的求值及所有环境更新已有形式定义。公式构造子自由且有限，所以递归存在唯一，输入上的真值均确定。这里固定经典元语言；不能把此接口误用为直觉主义 Kripke 满足关系。遮住本节后，前两节仍已确定全部真值条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment","status":"resolved","id":"b0118b1d3360ec7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]] 的 $\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta$、各公式构造子及环境更新。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_a,\\mathcal A_a,\\operatorname{val}_\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"t,s\\in\\mathcal T_a","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}\\subseteq\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(t=_a s,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_\\eta(t)=\\operatorname{val}_\\eta(s),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\bot_a,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ 0=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(A\\land_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\land\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(A\\lor_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\lor\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(A\\to_a B,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(B,\\eta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(\\forall_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{AT}(\\exists_a x_i A,\\eta)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m]).","display":true}],"bytes":2903,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c7ce8536d0e2df","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态公式集 $\\mathcal F_m$；算术项、公式 $\\mathcal A_a$、句子 $\\operatorname{Sent}_A$、数码、环境和 $\\operatorname{SubNum}_a$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-formula-environment]]，标准解释关系 $\\mathsf{AT}$ 取 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth|df-arithmetic-standard-truth — Standard truth of arithmetic formulas]]"},{"id":"e39710a1818d0447","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{AT}$ 为 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]] 的标准真值关系。以下按有限公式树递归引入 $\\mathsf{NRT}\\subseteq\\omega\\times\\mathcal A_a\\times\\omega^\\omega$；右侧量词及联结词属于元语言，$\\varphi_n(m)\\downarrow=k$ 使用既有部分计算图。"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-222","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth|df-arithmetic-standard-truth — Standard truth of arithmetic formulas]]"},{"id":"75662f8a477e661f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NR}$、可接受编号 $\\varphi_e$ 及配对 $p$ 使用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的固定结构；$\\mathsf{AT}$ 采用 [[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth|72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]"}],"outgoing":["b0118b1d3360ec7d"]}